        "message": "Instrument the semantic layer's observation and update timing\n\nPair-1-on-tfwitness follow-up (user-approved instrument-first): the\non-arm controller cycle blocked ~160 ms wall at motion start and the\ncommand chain correctly failed command_expired; the suspects are the\nobservation callback's digest/projection work under state_mutex_ and\nits contention with updateBounds on the costmap update thread (the\ncontroller reads the costmap under the master map mutex). Added\ndiagnostics only, no behavior change: per-observation segment timings\n(total, digest, TF lookup, projection) logged on every accepted\nobservation at ~7/s, and updateBounds lock-wait and total duration\nlogged when slow (>=15 ms total or >=5 ms lock wait)."
